                                "zh": "你应该在腿部训练日加入<w>保加利亚剪跨</w>来锻炼臀部肌肉。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Doing a <w>Bulgarian</w> split squat requires a lot of balance and core strength.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
